From: YaPcore Agent 3 <agent-3@yapcore>
Subject: [PATCH] YaP partition stability: min-entities + coalesce quiet + null-safe split

Gate force-partition on live entity count (avoid worldgen shred), hold
merge-inhibit quiet after partition, and null-safe entity redistribution
on region split. Post-applyAllPatches. Depends on 0014/0015.
